(
    title: "Human Cannonball",
    description: Some("Angle the cannon, set the muzzle speed and fire a stuntman at a distant water tower. The first four variations let you shove the tower left or right while he is still in the air; the last four fix it in place and hang a moving window in front that he has to pass through. Seven hits or seven misses ends the game."),
